02:15:04,622 --> 02:15:12,452
Well, if we wanted to determine if our knowledge base entails some query alpha, then we are going to enumerate all possible models.

1502
02:15:12,942 --> 02:15:20,260
In other words, consider all possible values of true and false for our variables, all possible states in which our world can be in.

1503
02:15:21,166 --> 02:15:30,404
And if in every model where our knowledge base is true, alpha is also true, then we know that the knowledge base entails alpha.

1504
02:15:31,054 --> 02:15:33,764
So let's take a closer look at that sentence and try and figure out what it actually means.

1505
02:15:34,176 --> 02:15:41,092
If we know that in every model, in other words, in every possible world, no matter what assignment of true and false to variables you give.

