05:46:15,118 --> 05:46:20,420
And it turns out there are a couple of ways that we could do that, and it doesn't matter if we randomly choose among all the ways that are the best,

3712
05:46:20,718 --> 05:46:26,820
but one such possible way is by taking a look at this hospital here and considering the directions in which it might move.

3713
05:46:26,958 --> 05:46:28,612
If we hold this hospital constant.

3714
